      "message": "Yes, it is intended to do that in the CL.\nWoV is only supported in the npcx7m7wb. Before this CL, npcx7m6f(x) and npcx7m7wb share the same \nBOARD_VERSION (\u003d2). I have to manually undef/define the CONFIG_WAKE_ON_VOICE when I switched the chip variant between npcx7m6f(x) and npcx7m7wb. It is annoying. So I decide to add BOARD_VERSION \u003d 3 for npcx7m7wb.",
